## 1. No Grant

This software, its source code, documentation, voice pack manifests, and all
Chiti-original assets are the property of Chiti Technologies and are protected
by copyright and other intellectual property laws.

No license is granted by this file. You may not copy, modify, distribute,
sublicense, sell, or use this software for any purpose except as expressly
authorized in a separate written agreement signed by Chiti Technologies.

Any internal use by Chiti personnel and any contractor work performed under a
signed agreement is permitted, subject to the third-party obligations in
section 4.

## 2. Voice Packs (`.cvpack`) — Separately Licensed

A `.cvpack` container is not covered by section 1 to the extent it embeds
third-party model weights or training data. Each pack carries its own
`license`, `provenance.model_license`, `provenance.dataset_attribution`, and
`provenance.consent_obtained` fields.

Those fields are **declarations of fact about the enclosed model**. They must
be copied from, and verified against, the actual upstream model card and the
actual speaker/consent documentation at the moment the model is added.

> A `.cvpack` whose provenance block does not match the reality of its
> embedded model is a liability, not a formality. Packs must not ship with
> placeholder, inferred, or aspirational provenance.

## 3. Contributions

Contributions are accepted only under a signed Contributor License Agreement
